Subject: [PATCH] OB-5 final: close capability-selection ambiguities through
 existing owners

- Visual Thinking: the owner recognizes the meaning (visual manner, layout,
  relations, seeing-thinker) instead of four literal phrase lists; paraphrase
  family and negative controls certified.
- Founder decision, business model: the Living Model Canvas owns the member's
  business model (object from the terminology registry); exploring the
  business goes to Claire; Claire offers the canvas after a settled change.
- Founder decision, big decision: deliberation about this / own affairs is
  offered to the Board (also from a discussion turn, never executed);
  explicit strategy work goes to the Strategy Chamber; ADHD strategies to
  the library; both explicit asks once.
- Honest adapter rows: Events, Strategy Chamber, Visual Thinking, Avatar
  Builder and LMC are partially connected (no chat result summary); Visual
  Thinking no longer promises to carry the conversation.
- Certification: finalConnection.ob5f (72); OB-5/5C pins updated to the
  Founder decisions.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
